{"job_id":"F-4c9e9bdb22cf0d5d27c9","family_id":"F-4c9e9bdb22cf0d5d27c9","title":"재외공관 무관주재령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":10,"target_id":"2fce1a4b425e6210259dc31c95fd75d51169c027bac28bb9e5ef9b7f4ad22a11","source_hash":"ab4ebbc19ab81e6bedded70dbe1147618cd372b4f3b14e5a9e179c1efab60205","text":"关于驻外使团武官住所的命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":75,"target_id":"7188208ee830da38eca84abfd357619df84df3f29ce692984794159b7c50f184","source_hash":"db516be0da0d086d08e6deb02123ee0b96246cce18adec255be2f7690184c1e4","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定驻外外交使团韩国武装部队军官的任命、监督、任期、人员编制等必要事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":75,"end":138,"target_id":"e1df1da371fb0eee94faffbab0d33975a57009957cfc0a0c499c5052a0b30296","source_hash":"9e9d709236b0fc29273d89e3177ecae7d31eb2a3fe8f0507c53e8b3048f64a7e","text":"第二条（设立）国防部长可根据军事需要，向海外外交使团派遣武装部队军官（以下简称“常驻武官”）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":138,"end":166,"target_id":"a4ce36e5905244fce80f4062a18930fa01425f947e46bb4aa62a102ac2f1b542","source_hash":"d56361ae456e62710693dbf7e0c3f1bb9da1cd78d6240e86fbb5694f26289c57","text":"第三条（任命）国防部长任命常驻财政专员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":166,"end":306,"target_id":"93b7972999b65d9be896ce47e0625e4bddffe701ef2874036e6f86df3342ca7a","source_hash":"100630586710e60fc52e7d6222f017f79eaada2319960f9544fc986cc30e1d2c","text":"第四条（指挥与监督）有关驻外使团团长（以下简称“使团团长”）负责指挥和监督武官履行职责。但是，在军事事务中，经国防部长与外交部长协商决定的事项，由国防部长负责指挥和监督。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":306,"end":436,"target_id":"d8e1b1d9c688b3388919f0033b4ac3d00e301065581703873aa2f0fc7530f3fe","source_hash":"282ba92c82866afa1e37407624ebac9b78b2c4f466c823feb1a99072671a3a56","text":"第五条（共同立场）\n① 常驻财务专员可兼任另一海外外交机构的常驻财务专员。\n② 驻外财务专员在履行第1款规定的其他海外使团职责时，应服从使团团长的指挥和监督。但是，第4条的但书规定，在履行军事事务职责时，应当比照适用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":436,"end":628,"target_id":"86749677c1d7c5a17c135ec504d9542f67827ae3248d2481041ad58826d9a17e","source_hash":"df55db28dea5639410bc86b92d1da5f09b5242b336339a60be075b7763acfa9c","text":"第6条（首席武官）\n① 在同一海外外交使团驻有两名或两名以上常驻武官时，由国防部长指定的武官为首席武官，首席武官应按照第四条的规定，在使团团长或国防部长的指挥和监督下，指导和监督其他常驻武官。\n② 国防部长可根据第1款规定，在首席武官的指挥和监督下，任命其他常驻武官为武官或助理武官。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":628,"end":790,"target_id":"7da1c45ad175657a81fbae01701aa823fc39b898ee2bd8e6e36e71e6db7a910d","source_hash":"16955f2aaaa67466e36cb5116d2b230f0dd97694ebb857ab7edfc4a6c64adccc","text":"第七条（职务报告）  驻外武官（或在同一驻外使团设有两名或两名以上武官时，由首席武官）应当于次月10日前向有关使团团长报告当月职务情况，再向国防部长报告。但如有紧急情况，可随时向使团团长报告，再向国防部长报告。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":790,"end":901,"target_id":"dbb1ac178543a0eff318bf0ad5b7a88e3a29a71cfdb9cdac65dacd669a5e134e","source_hash":"11d2048207975247fc874532c7d631f98807a447bb786f6f32064334992b32d5","text":"第八条（任期）财政部副部长的任期为三年。但是，国防部长认为有必要时，经与外交部长协商，可延长或缩短其任期，延长或缩短的幅度不超过一年。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":901,"end":935,"target_id":"8984e00da2563581a64f08974952179829ae932fb576f633ff20f96465863eb2","source_hash":"3c01e8acdd23c54bcbc7ef5a7be57aa830698b1d96578a2a4bb0abc8720d15e9","text":"第九条（薪酬）财政部副部长的薪酬由总统令另行确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":935,"end":1190,"target_id":"7759c60d818316bb54621007bf03475d40e9561afc8b046823089bdee2044b9b","source_hash":"25b66f846fadb6447b6749de6b26a8a70c2f9b4a2968982c67a9c1b50ce6ad57","text":"第10条（人员配额）\n① 常驻财政专员的核定人数见附件表格，国防部长应依据《国防组织及职权总则》及相关法律，在核定人数范围内进行管理；但变更核定人数时，国防部长应与外交部长及计划预算部长协商。<2013年3月23日、2017年9月19日、2025年12月30日修订>\n② 国防部长在根据第1款规定分配或变更各驻外使团常驻武官名额时，应当与外交部长协商。<2013年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1190,"end":1214,"target_id":"7f90f7689971394b498df5533d55b1de4f3de57384e3f47ba174aaaf10cf0399","source_hash":"97e2f2b95bd14260e3ed41ee8a7ce769e6477b1829ce3552a6631e63d9353bae","text":"补充规定 <第21426号，2009年4月20日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1214,"end":1243,"target_id":"32458043003fc4059972288f7e80cfb2d34db3f7d3ed4a2376f8ec9f900ddb21","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1243,"end":1343,"target_id":"4466bde0c28e90c747abf7be3bce73eb1c08f8c4e07b9a686e14f0aef864bf3c","source_hash":"97dda1bc364cf1e0688b9704948d4fb7c9dfe005e2a7e293d2c88e87842359f7","text":"第二条（关于外交武官助理的过渡措施）根据以前规定任命的外交武官助理，应视为根据第六条第二款的修正规定，在本法令生效的同时被任命为外交武官助理。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1343,"end":1667,"target_id":"05bec4924030cfbe14023efefc35d98ce4f59ff76fcfd17c609466f1f8aa0d17","source_hash":"ff713e5ff3546573999326b3a4965cb694d400602a46e486ca3bb04738553b4c","text":"第三条（关于副武官配额的过渡措施）① 在本法令生效时，超过附件所列配额的24名副武官（包括副武官助理；以下简称“副武官”），自本法令生效之日起至各相关副武官根据第二款规定任期届满之日止，应视为在各驻外使团拥有与其人数相对应的单独配额。\n\n  ② 根据第1款任命的常驻财政专员中，2006年任命的财政专员任期届满日期为2009年7月31日，2007年任命的财政专员任期届满日期为2009年12月31日，2008年任命的财政专员任期届满日期为2010年7月31日。但是，驻伊拉克财政专员助理的任期届满日期为2009年12月31日。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1667,"end":1711,"target_id":"3f6e83502af36be17358f5cc5712dfb79e1cd0138b4d756176339ace5c860b24","source_hash":"5083fb99771287cfb4604d6088d0025b000eb52928167e28b024fdd4bb58df4d","text":"补充条款 <第22415号，2010年10月1日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1711,"end":1751,"target_id":"ef2802510a8be36108256c9284b7129fe7d22e23da16b1af6ed908ba2ed2a77f","source_hash":"ff6f25ff86490fda66dcfbd21c8fbf51192d7fdbb2370dc7d7477d407e53d397","text":"增编（国防部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2013年3月23日，第24413号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1751,"end":1780,"target_id":"166823dd8fead6a82e1c2fe7b6c515e30af840cf6f407c4a19542bd68d60c090","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1780,"end":1788,"target_id":"ac22f742c077decfb0d07e8b8e66cd6136a9a3300dfcecec3d6ac9c4b09ffc6e","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1788,"end":1854,"target_id":"2fa99e10047966774078eb0022a239a6c6291891fd563373e383a114e74eaba7","source_hash":"27726d7618b11b3eaf5e40f965c161980b700157735994225ee3aa478389de39","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至<24>款省略\n\n  <25> 关于驻外武官居住地的法令修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1854,"end":1937,"target_id":"ac68c6f7203d1f343d22792f9afc1f463fdc5aaa25a9311f1d22d3be32a7c395","source_hash":"f64a4aa268c35c6ee25e90115660382f95bd6d2bbc0123b7efaec71a8f3899f8","text":"  在第 4 条的但书、第 8 条的但书以及第 10 条第 1 款和第 2 款中，“外交和贸易部长”应改为“外交部长”。\n\n  <26> 至 <32> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1937,"end":1981,"target_id":"991b19cba485bdc74001db9b585e96f501fe7e590ec898169c757ac6d3efa4e9","source_hash":"da88c500a7879cb361c7e790cb4e8ebeed22f1504fe98995320ea00df3dc2af9","text":"补充规定 <第25466号，2014年7月16日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1981,"end":2025,"target_id":"47cb09b08544ee4c10489dc474289e218d815778a2d487c3d7cdeded7df7a199","source_hash":"3d4ff454c1185867fd3554c054de77b19a04cb3f037d0403f28582a664746baa","text":"补充条款 <第26881号，2016年1月12日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2025,"end":2069,"target_id":"44713461c5cf312834484b19ef174d3bbfae24f552cb943a9ce124be8f726811","source_hash":"f6a5edbff390cdf22a0460fd847006517d65e399476214c70c9321e3f537f682","text":"补充规定 <第28298号，2017年9月19日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2069,"end":2112,"target_id":"c8179bcb7b15b7ada80c9a3dce599fd356cbbde011378a86326558e30a04e878","source_hash":"bfabee8ab7c9838d07d27e4c346134293cafb64ff5bd4d75944a9c2662267a66","text":"补充规定 <第30385号，2020年2月4日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2112,"end":2155,"target_id":"30ba0453eadba52d6d7aa943a7d104e8ec348edbabe1d32aacff6c3dcaa0f6a6","source_hash":"e94cb060215343794849c45723917db1ef36905da0729360d1209f1fd79739ab","text":"增编（计划和预算部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第35948号，2025年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2155,"end":2285,"target_id":"1b84c2398046272559d62265b4f687b2ffccdec62525f4a2b74a12b77a30f725","source_hash":"d91ca08ab13d680b646c74aa4763cd8612c6e937853e3db26fe10f30e26d8871","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2026年1月2日起生效。但是，根据本补充法令第四条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前颁布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2285,"end":2299,"target_id":"bf3907af77311ed5986d434742894c7374cf180bf9061308f67bcfb38be2e4df","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2299,"end":2781,"target_id":"52ba5108d5dc9589e8f32b50cd31fa491bd2dd94f60aaa8184c08d8cb34018f5","source_hash":"783bca033a1c23517011e2ac0e18855e91adfd70bf59692f5704528ad20ee552","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<44> 已省略\n\n  <45> 关于驻外武官居住地的法令修改如下。\n\n  第十条第一款中的“战略与财政大臣兼外交部长”应改为“外交部长兼计划与预算大臣”。\n\n  <46> 至 <176> 已省略\n\n首席财务官人员配备表（与第10条第1款相关）\n■ 关于驻外使团武官居住地的法令 [附表] <2020年2月4日修订>\n\n  主要财务主管表（与第十条第一款相关）                   \n\n┌────┬──┬─────┬─────┬─────┐\n\n│구분    │총계│육군      │해군      │공군      │\n\n│        │    ├──┬──┼──┬──┼──┬──┤\n\n│        │    │장성│영관│장성│영관│장성│영관│\n\n├────┼──┼──┼──┼──┼──┼──┼──┤\n\n│人数（人）│77 │2 │39 │1 │17 │1 │17 │\n\n└────┴──┴──┴──┴──┴──┴──┴──┘"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00001","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201024","source_hash":"bc8b025df8a4cbc32a313f87d758136fdefef40867a2293274a7191974880cb0","text":"■ 关于驻外使团武官居住地的法令 [附表] <2020年2月4日修订>"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00002","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201025","source_hash":"efcd04a0423198e56e470a4c0392e21477824c439a14a0e833e57ba20b45cc58","text":"首席财务官人员配备表（与第10条第1款相关）"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00003","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201026","source_hash":"d8ba487317ac4e370c544ff11fee92077c5dfe235d14d8d93e213e278685f7be","text":"分类MTQ29f13724665d54a300119结束"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00004","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201027","source_hash":"377f72fda84be763609d7eb5b5f6f19a3fe3a84550933f9d1c34e4c64cd986ac","text":"总计"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00005","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201028","source_hash":"895657014fe53de541958318056ce90efba585587182c83a2dd43ce25a140c52","text":"陆军"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00006","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201029","source_hash":"51f4249568bd1e593470a04f982d9b3d732a312bd0d998575b2235284de0c080","text":"海军蓝"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00007","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201030","source_hash":"20eb16eaf23ce6e55781a9d42280077fdd75df3fd4e74d3b2a72edd7ad57814a","text":"空军"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00008","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201031","source_hash":"ce48c72cd7045f62834fbf62cbe2ea1f15aed03bdfff278351bff4b4954252d3","text":"长城"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00009","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201032","source_hash":"4c15dd7ab587f38997a3b1f8c6ccd6522e288563407b8aeef89d41565151186e","text":"灵官"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00010","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201033","source_hash":"ce48c72cd7045f62834fbf62cbe2ea1f15aed03bdfff278351bff4b4954252d3","text":"长城"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00011","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201034","source_hash":"4c15dd7ab587f38997a3b1f8c6ccd6522e288563407b8aeef89d41565151186e","text":"灵官"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00012","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201035","source_hash":"ce48c72cd7045f62834fbf62cbe2ea1f15aed03bdfff278351bff4b4954252d3","text":"长城"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00013","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201036","source_hash":"4c15dd7ab587f38997a3b1f8c6ccd6522e288563407b8aeef89d41565151186e","text":"灵官"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00014","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201037","source_hash":"201b06be0c5e2b1586eb5c3a23695ac3ee83348bb62a2a73fa27b9f0aede1fcc","text":"人员(persons)"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00015","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201038","source_hash":"a88a7902cb4ef697ba0b6759c50e8c10297ff58f942243de19b984841bfe1f73","text":"77"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00016","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201039","source_hash":"d4735e3a265e16eee03f59718b9b5d03019c07d8b6c51f90da3a666eec13ab35","text":"2"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00017","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201040","source_hash":"0b918943df0962bc7a1824c0555a389347b4febdc7cf9d1254406d80ce44e3f9","text":"39"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00018","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201041","source_hash":"6b86b273ff34fce19d6b804eff5a3f5747ada4eaa22f1d49c01e52ddb7875b4b","text":"1"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00019","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201042","source_hash":"4523540f1504cd17100c4835e85b7eefd49911580f8efff0599a8f283be6b9e3","text":"17"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00020","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201043","source_hash":"6b86b273ff34fce19d6b804eff5a3f5747ada4eaa22f1d49c01e52ddb7875b4b","text":"1"},{"id":"A30023-zh-00021","doc":"A30023","law_id":"kr-004643-281495-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2201044","source_hash":"4523540f1504cd17100c4835e85b7eefd49911580f8efff0599a8f283be6b9e3","text":"17"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":15,"target_id":"e77479f62f40c1684a787d7c2d1a5cbbc63b20c269dadf6f870c8a0be1af1d80","source_hash":"5f40600b84c3f606df2c523ed5bda912435a0d0c3601e9c75db4f009d48c0928","text":"关于驻外使团武官任命法令的执行细则"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":55,"target_id":"bc0f07a5d01b6506d772de679696a8b740c06dda009dadbd85d7552a4db192a3","source_hash":"c13ba34b4e75020e9edff558c43d5d9b074092b286427264aa25fa2f7676534b","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定执行“驻外使团武官条例”所必需的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":55,"end":247,"target_id":"27bd5aea2cd302da13f9f6e23d0c0146108d76de0b09cdc18e1870cee870f964","source_hash":"eca6ad50b296faf53ff63fc983cabdba0c24c96f39b8fdffc8880fa2443bc1eb","text":"第二条（定义）本规则中使用的术语含义如下。\n1. “海外外交机构”是指大韩民国在外国设立的大使馆、公使馆、代表处、总领事馆和领事馆。\n2. “武官处”一词是指根据《驻外使团武官条例》（以下简称“条例”）第2条规定，大韩民国武装部队军官（以下简称“武官”）在驻外使团履行其职责的机构。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":247,"end":267,"target_id":"6fd7422c82e5731417624fa1f279eacf058f90008c7e39fefb0389d3f05a2677","source_hash":"8bc21566ed339ea55abaea7e180cc594caab1e086ccb4a8b3bb96bebf1827d10","text":"删除条款 3 <2012.12.3>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":267,"end":469,"target_id":"21489ef66be4ae5a11b1741559f3bd3dc58d2fbc7a19f60b184e3a348c74801f","source_hash":"afaea917b26b29e603fe6dd578fbd11f5c3f44c28821d4372a33c4536e328480","text":"第四条（武官军衔）武官军衔为中校以上；但派驻海外使团有两名或两名以上武官的，武官军衔按下列各款规定确定。<2018年7月4日修订>\n1. 根据法令第6条第1款设立的高级武官（以下简称“高级武官”）：中校或以上军衔\n2. 根据法令第6条第2款规定，军官：中校或以上军衔\n3. 根据法令第6条第2款，武官：中校或以下军衔\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":469,"end":812,"target_id":"b2496604614c788e146983eb78fa83563dd375fdf3a6e5e15443e0c23aaa8eb2","source_hash":"3fc424eff036393c03308293fbdd102c58fd4ce836e2d7b47085291e6aa93a80","text":"第五条（常驻财政专员的遴选和任命）\n① 武官由国防部长根据陆军、海军、空军（以下简称“各军种”）参谋长（海军陆战队由海军陆战队司令推荐；下文同上）、国防部直属机关负责人或国防采办计划管理局局长等的推荐，从自愿申请者中选拔任命。但为执行特殊任务，国防部长可指定并选拔人员担任武官。\n② 国防部长可根据第1款规定设立并运作常驻财务官员遴选委员会，以遴选常驻财务官员。\n③ 驻地财务专员的资格要求、遴选的详细程序以及驻地财务专员遴选审议委员会的组成和运作等事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":812,"end":1000,"target_id":"87124fc0986242bf38134d9ca25baf2b95f8aadd638106e5e6bf97743e3b264e","source_hash":"07f7d63a7e34ed4583984e171c9e09e97d0a6c03efa980b9f93c14c93bdafc8b","text":"第五条第二款（常驻财务专员的教育和培训）\n① 国防部长依据第五条第一款和第二款选拔武官时，应当在派遣武官到驻在国之前对其进行动员训练，以培养其履行职责的基本素质和能力。\n② 国防部长可在派遣期间定期召集国内外常驻财务专员进行工作培训，以提高其履行职责的能力。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1000,"end":1020,"target_id":"7258dbe5c5443632ae27b41749d7811a6035e4a58bf5f9c1ec8803d476e7c75f","source_hash":"6b9d9d26273f646f796048aa3baddd6287c844dc799bbc2298380531f3e10cde","text":"删除第 6 条 <2012.12.3>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1020,"end":1113,"target_id":"600c85c15d6fa2d2c51b0c114618e6b19cf28aee7f7ff5cbc2a24199765b69d3","source_hash":"9d9ffbe342efea5907b428200607ec22d9fa8b468d75ca8aaaf128c66f5651fb","text":"第七条（外交随员登记）外交随员应当按照居住国（包括共同管辖国；以下同上）的法律或习惯进行登记。<1984年10月5日、2012年12月3日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1113,"end":1447,"target_id":"af71987abc7fd23fc44cf713b388e8f6a1ce84a677016f6f3f5eb751743e280b","source_hash":"f27aa87d430f63b5eeebe0d4cd21be85a17257fda86acfe75663820bbae10c91","text":"第八条（驻地财政专员的职责）驻地财政专员应当履行下列各款规定的职责。\n1. 与国防外交、国防交流与合作及相关支持有关的活动\n2. 影响国家安全的数据收集和报告\n3. 支持国防工业材料进出口\n4. 针对东道国和驻该国外国金融专员的各种推广活动\n5. 合作与支持所有与海外部署相关的事宜\n6. 为派往驻在国的军事人员提供支持，并保护国防部下属机构的文职雇员和人员\n7. 派往东道国的联络官和委任学员的管理\n8. 向驻外使团团长提供军事事务方面的协助\n9. 国防部长或驻外使团团长指示的其他事项\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1447,"end":1522,"target_id":"a8d407fcefc0df15408cc7f6fd26d0969e0d21e7326ae6489b6646eb99d9a706","source_hash":"ddde4b0e3f6d86aa45ba0dcfc159fea8391ee8d7887214a28cfecf671b3fa21c","text":"第九条（常驻武官的资历） 两个以上常驻武官被派往同一海外外交使团的，常驻武官的资历按照《军事人员管理法实施令》第二条的规定确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1522,"end":1728,"target_id":"5503933f0c7db4ea660643708b016fe2a668642a8c737aca9133d5b5532956bb","source_hash":"a6554cfad5737ab705efc0894afee2145f662459060c3a36e0dde35b83db7879","text":"第十条（首席武官的职责和权限）首席武官履行第八条规定的职责，并根据本法令第六条第一款的规定，指导和监督其他常驻武官处理下列各款所列事项。<2012年12月3日修订；2018年7月4日修订>\n1. 其他国家财政官员履行第8条规定的职责\n2. 武官处财产的管理和运营\n3. 海外使团武官处一般事务处理\n4. 武官处预算与会计\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1728,"end":1860,"target_id":"fd5b3355f5fbccc740fbafd3c360e0cb96e6036fa480dd1ad6aaae45dcf0b0cd","source_hash":"748b9bf0c1bcffd9527ccf1e63a7ca1e510f411bcef48ea5f946e3ca791163b1","text":"第11条（高级武官的代理职责）  高级武官发生意外时，由级别次高的常驻武官代行其职责。  在此情况下，代理高级武官的常驻武官应当立即向国防部长报告。<2012年12月3日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1860,"end":2005,"target_id":"baab26643e2dedb3c131cd8bfb0b88b6662f2ac44e11e8e4cdb2dd094883f972","source_hash":"3a0cd4928f5f52692860e46a78b20211241001c7898b9434ac571a1c2e9b6fa4","text":"第十二条（非首席武官的常驻武官的代理职责）  若非首席武官的常驻武官发生意外，首席武官可指定另一名常驻武官代行其职责。在此情况下，首席武官应立即向国防部长报告。<2012年12月3日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00015","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2005,"end":2120,"target_id":"06b6caea2a3cff3f08c8d5fb9fdf609ea6a6380f77f85437e2934cdacd61e6ce","source_hash":"51ebb3dda276d7c13c0e43a2e3d162453a36c790d84c22af846a49c1491687fb","text":"第十三条（处理国防部长与使团团长相互矛盾的指示）  常驻武官收到使团团长和国防部长分别相互矛盾的指示时，应当立即向国防部长报告，并接受其指示。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00016","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2120,"end":2185,"target_id":"5a1e06ce4efa5b3e3923bf9812d888a6c0c8dbb2704027ddc400cc6b7970c0cd","source_hash":"92e7ba39704bb570eae25d2c458a5ee1a0caa78bfb8fe2066b625272a9cead4b","text":"第十四条（副武官的官方公告） 副武官未经使团团长同意和国防部长许可，不得对外发布任何官方公告。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00017","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2185,"end":2312,"target_id":"0976f0b2aef97a0681ded8bc275faaf33610c55b1d4c5bddb92ad47131e1918a","source_hash":"a1310acaef5a9c9a8b5d50528085303fe853e8f56dcef02b048a06694e562472","text":"第十五条（外交武官的旅行和临时返回）  外交武官前往驻在国境内其他地区旅行，须经使团团长批准；前往驻在国以外的国家旅行或临时返回，须经国防部长许可。<2012年12月3日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00018","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2312,"end":2367,"target_id":"384534df55f9d035790d73b37e8af8bbbeeb34c11f631325858946cab67a90a7","source_hash":"1cffee56666f8206166504b9782b5ca4ebbdbfda01b730d299fc4c04d418c92b","text":"第十六条（报告）常驻财务专员应当按照国防部长另行确定的方式报告其工作情况。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00019","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2367,"end":2422,"target_id":"1c6d3e6eb2463d52c2971b9e88a4134b446d9a148f439602455843b7715ae09a","source_hash":"196e9bd37fa98cef45fa3c1288f99e9c0886b2c5ed87888175c15010d3ff5748","text":"第十七条（武官署预算）武官署所需的预算由国防部长另行决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00020","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2422,"end":2489,"target_id":"e1d226a5794365b9bfa097f8ce1c0c9e0dd42e13439fa3add216ff3b67442aba","source_hash":"9dfb585add65e6451fbd57e765a534f90b2ef5b241bf012b48dee341618e4007","text":"第十八条（文件处理）驻外外交使团武官处一般文件和军事秘密文件的处理事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00021","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2489,"end":2606,"target_id":"42be022465ceeec5b7d6d4cc7cf2f9c018118e20c3b47bd9dbac2e02c58aef78","source_hash":"6cfd736e52b250f6e764179a59c4f29202b2be3f27371aea9aac7f6b9b01d982","text":"第十九条（驻地财务官等的培训）各军种参谋长应当通过语言教育等方式培训优秀的驻地财务官，并努力通过设立驻地财务官专门岗位等人员管理制度，确保驻地财务官的专业技能得到充分利用。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00022","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2606,"end":2648,"target_id":"50021cc59c9d48427dff22e5f586a946e8ac57a2a53ed9c1955cc26cf1494159","source_hash":"56082533da37d4497b561541d5569b1bfd7b23236d6040c85a82a7adb2dbd4d6","text":"补充规定 <第169号，1969年8月4日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00023","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2648,"end":2690,"target_id":"e10c681eb86f4729bdcc6ee1439197352651229699001897ccc292269f89e6fd","source_hash":"8374f5be46421448a6b68df51a8ab47bc2f15172bd1235c33cb8dbf06a70b8f7","text":"补充条款 <第248号，1974年1月8日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00024","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2690,"end":2733,"target_id":"0dddabb48ec2286793b1f3667c7c346d06d351e7fccf20ae686f9901441610fa","source_hash":"4ac8b44d669684ef021116b9de0de5874e1079baf4126f2953aeb9fef8f6be02","text":"补充规定 <第256号，1974年9月25日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00025","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2733,"end":2777,"target_id":"7a01e47228649e6982e8759b2daeaa4dc805f727886e180555027741e267dabe","source_hash":"da469601df16362faf3fe2f6c8ede4da18c9daef52b46a005c75a9bfdd544f83","text":"补充规定 <第364号，1984年10月5日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00026","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2777,"end":2820,"target_id":"7d111444c5e881a7c43953f740c8b812f28c80bec5ec10d5927a35d2c8ae2fdf","source_hash":"1fefdfb338c4a82cf3d9730849e0fdf66f5a8e9ea6ccceaece67a5ee6a8599cc","text":"补充规定 <第432号，1992年8月20日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00027","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2820,"end":2864,"target_id":"e542aeff24ce5bdfd26489fa54dc03eb663e484552abcbb19161df39b24529d6","source_hash":"caf8ee8f9fe30c6613f008055e359f22730780d5a061344bfc365af472045f3f","text":"补充规定 <第451号，1994年12月20日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00028","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2864,"end":2907,"target_id":"b7d6c39298800f0bf71cb1e3662e22e21d71974a8585b32402fc42c3b19f82bb","source_hash":"b78b1db20c1d4ac1c13c083611e539323dbbc9463fc0cc5e6f0496f6ad722746","text":"补充规定 <第781号，2012年12月3日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00029","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2907,"end":2950,"target_id":"947bde1fa0f8e39c4643b2408168bc055ad41a1383539aefe6940746bc2733d8","source_hash":"a67891ea27dc6f98dc165c4841722c682ecd7dc2e8525b8204dcca275a7dab15","text":"补充规定 <第927号，2017年6月19日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00030","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2950,"end":2971,"target_id":"f04f9fe1ab64c77a6fe858e99cffdc458ac584647a8e140f3d4d91e189338c8c","source_hash":"6314efdf2a745ea700797210785856e263ed476251ee8a6483838ddc1b3a7300","text":"补充规定 <第965号，2018年7月4日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00031","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2971,"end":3001,"target_id":"8820bf8748d49e500d02f3be1e9a97744f0872d2dd5f93a2da96d94fb2ea36e5","source_hash":"0d63a18201aaf2f1d98d1a1c71f36ac02913f4fc2004246a24afe6bdd25c6c45","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00032","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-008000-204045-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3001,"end":3067,"target_id":"e2a1b5809860ed2d67babeda581f0982afefb9fbd3b50911f0ab488e37c5f9f6","source_hash":"cae496047f7e0bdc9df2473dddcd19b721cac5571bc5bbaf465aa76d725cd3a8","text":"第二条（适用于助理武官级别）第四条第三款的修正规定，自本规则生效后任命助理武官之日起适用。"}]}